[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496945325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99654#issuecomment-2496945325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99654","id":2496945325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U1Fyt","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T06:09:33Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T06:09:33Z","body":"> However unfolding visible_characters does not work that well with autowrap. The word will start appearing at the end of line and then jump to the next line as it gets wrapped. It looks very jarring and many people reported this problem when playtesting my game.\n\n> The problem is that the only way to fix it is changing visible_characters_behavior from the default Characters Before Shaping to Characters After Shaping. This makes get_line_count() always return all lines, even if hidden by visible_characters.\n\nThese looks like expected behavior, in `Characters Before Shaping` mode, \"hidden\" lines do not exist at all, text is trimmed before processing (changing `visible_characters` should be equivalent of typing text in). So RTL has no idea how many line wraps there will be (`\\r` counts as forced line wrap), but still count all paragraphs (`\\n` is used as paragraph separator).\n\nNot sure if it can be fully fixed, but:\n- It can estimate at least the number of mandatory breaks.\n- Should be better documented.\n- `\\r\\n` probably should be used as paragraph separator as well (customizable, maybe add separate paragraph spacing as well).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496945325/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2497381172","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99654#issuecomment-2497381172","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99654","id":2497381172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U2wM0","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T09:22:00Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T09:24:55Z","body":"We may also consider changing default mode to `VC_CHARS_AFTER_SHAPING` or `VC_GLYPHS_AUTO`, since it's probably more expected behavior for a lot of cases.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2497381172/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922412293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99654#issuecomment-2922412293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99654","id":2922412293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uMHkF","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T13:32:10Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T13:32:10Z","body":"Still valid in `v4.4.1.stable`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922412293/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0